    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88363" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπομπ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>escorting,</i> esp. <i>in
				procession,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					4.5.17
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοὰς π.</span>
			<i>carrying</i> drink-offerings <i>in procession,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				23
			</span></i>(lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>conductor, escort, protector,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1036
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.1.2
			</span></i>; of Hermes, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				89
			</span></i>; of the Furies, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				206
			</span></i>; of priestesses of Athena, ib. <i><span class="en">
				1005
			</span></i>(anap.); of <i>attendants</i> in a funeral procession,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				1074
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τιρώνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLips.</u>
					35.5
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">iv A.D.</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				3.563
			</span></i>).</div>
